Let's plan:

- Prepare origin (attach, confirm prepared)
- Activate origin node
- Load origin payload
- Assign operator to origin
- Lock origin (now origin has task profile linked, operator linked, locked)
- Release operator from origin (optional)
- Detach task profile from origin (making it available)
- Prepare destination (attach task profile to destination, confirm prepared)
- Activate destination node
- Load destination payload
- Assign operator to destination
- Lock destination (now destination has task profile linked)
- Release operator from destination
- Detach task profile from destination (making it available)
- Attach task profile to origin again (for authorize)
- Assemble transport leg (requires origin_availability_locked, destination_availability_locked, etc) - note origin task profile linked now.
- Authorize transport leg loading (requires origin task profile linked)
- Detach task profile from origin (optional)
- Mark origin dispatch ready
- Mark destination dispatch ready
- Dispatch shift_candidate_alpha (to free vehicle and dispatch slot)
